潭州后得绝句四十首 其二十六","author":"赵蕃","text":"秀植如云不可穷，长杉钜竹略相同。\n嗟余讵可如材者，政似飘飘秋后枫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47030,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其三十六","author":"赵蕃","text":"落日苍苍烟树林，渚鸥沙鸟更浮沉。\n过湖未远犹空阔，不见遥山出寸岑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47031,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其三十一","author":"赵蕃","text":"去岁重阳事已讹，今年亦复病蹉跎。\n明年想见山中集，弟妹团栾黄菊歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47032,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其二十","author":"赵蕃","text":"仰山林壑旧曾游，拟欲重寻不自由。\n倚赖舣舟相对处，为予排闼向城头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47033,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其三十九","author":"赵蕃","text":"午蔼纷纷无奈浓，晚来微敛见山容。\n鹅湖旧日经行地，清吹思乘十里松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47034,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其五","author":"赵蕃","text":"罾塘断港劣容舟，鱍鱍盈篮叫不休。\n我亦买之将作腊，要和蔬茹绐饥喉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47035,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其十一","author":"赵蕃","text":"午风吹坼稻花香，晨雨翻掀稻叶凉。\n道上尘埃犹净尽，田间欢乐讵能量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47036,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其三十七","author":"赵蕃","text":"日之夕矣下羊牛，想见吾庐树掩幽。\n儿自閒行牛自去，溪头熟路不须求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47037,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其二十二","author":"赵蕃","text":"仰山山峙季溪流，知我东归俾暂留。\n尽日如推复如荡，为之成喜不成忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47038,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其十六","author":"赵蕃","text":"山驿虽荒亦可安，要眠杉月夜深寒。\n昨宵虚落才闻鼓，明夕江皋想枕湍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47039,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其三十五","author":"赵蕃","text":"暮色苍然遂不开，我舟亦欲傍崖隈。\n不唯帆过谁家宿，水鸟林栖亦并来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47040,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其二十三","author":"赵蕃","text":"两岸多为激水轮，创由人力用如神。\n山田枯旱湖田涝，惟此丰凶岁岁均。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47041,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其七","author":"赵蕃","text":"南风纵急但温其，小雨虽微却透肌。\n永日蓬窗难坐卧，祇随舷侧就阴移。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47042,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"鸥如玉洁鹭霜明，閒意相看了不惊。\n乃不悟予非慕者，决然飞背晚烟轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47043,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其二十五","author":"赵蕃","text":"鹭鸶虽说擅风标，永日滩头腹苦枵。\n凫鹜杂居宁自异，鸡群鹤处更加骄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47044,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其十二","author":"赵蕃","text":"一年风月属中秋，今昔相传无异流。\n定自天公亦兴此，故教雨脚破云头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47045,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其八","author":"赵蕃","text":"刻木如瓶粉渍之，挂林聊当酒家旗。\n我当物色登临处，亦复因之为解颐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47046,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"才把离觞已足悲，况哦别句慰相思。\n月明未比夜来别，人影已知天外追。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47047,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其二十九","author":"赵蕃","text":"病思昏昏略未醒，木犀谁遣浸饶瓶。\n兀然随我故山梦，竹故青青雨自零。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47048,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其六","author":"赵蕃","text":"投罾政尔不能逃，偶逭还遭别网要。\n此意岂能知数罟，不论他日且今朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47049,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其二十七","author":"赵蕃","text":"遥看巨石屹相冲，不道中江有路通。\n几度跨羸行荦确，又成全室寄蓬笼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47050,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其十","author":"赵蕃","text":"扁舟往作槠州过，烟雾空濛祇市声。\n今夕再来还小泊，却逢江月正空明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47051,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其三十八","author":"赵蕃","text":"大琛酒价旧知名，樟树姑洲得并行。\n晨起亟思谋一醉，远钟已作叫岩声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47052,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其三十三","author":"赵蕃","text":"季月将穷更起风，秋声乱杂橹声中。\n倦游归去浑忘事，淹速从渠不计穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47053,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其十九","author":"赵蕃","text":"溪上秋来境倍佳，附城犹尔况村赊。\n却嗟政尔营行棹，不得于兹理钓车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47054,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其二十一","author":"赵蕃","text":"晚日才能度两滩，诘朝应复又成乾。\n从来但说溯流苦，到我顺流良亦难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47055,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十一日 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"老去读书非少年，故怜觳觫尚加鞭。\n看竹偶然閒半日，归来还愧腹便便。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47056,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十八夜宿秀城外","author":"赵蕃","text":"月子弯弯四面歌，扁舟今夜泊嘉禾。\n颇欲歌呼起相和，一声轧轧又前波。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47057,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十五夜看月","author":"赵蕃","text":"碧天涌出烂银盘，万里颠风落树端。\n懒复持杯向渠问，径思飞步蹑翔鸾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47058,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十月十五日","author":"赵蕃","text":"柳行摇落参差际，雁字虚无灭没中。\n醉面红来因卯酒，征衣脆去为霜风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47059,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十月见菊二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"花前曳杖极徜徉，为汝临风一慨慷。\n直自东坡仙去后，无人十月作重阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47060,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十月见菊二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"黄花狼籍晚犹香，冷蝶频来著意忙。\n不见东篱千载士，自应埋没老风霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47061,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次签判丈惜花绝句三首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"春事违人去若狂，便惊鶗鴂怨年芳。\n儿童强作留连意，拾去残花学试妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47062,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次签判丈惜花绝句三首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"蚤作抽书对白间，瓦炉犹有宿香残。\n诗来报我群花尽，亟起巡檐忘帽寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47063,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次签判丈惜花绝句三首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"江南花草易芳菲，今我还家已似迟。\n最恨春风苦无思，卷藏红绮不容披。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47064,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵宋茂叔送行五绝兼谢修叔 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"前年过语漫匆匆，今喜追随数日同。\n诗里固知俱有味，酒边宁复重言功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47065,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵宋茂叔送行五绝兼谢修叔 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"平日长嗟取友难，年来颇得见班班。\n顾怜蹇步终无及，天马逍遥十二闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47066,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵宋茂叔送行五绝兼谢修叔 其五","author":"赵蕃","text":"山到穷时一径开，数松几竹与萦回。\n我归酿黍仍锄菜，准拟篮舆窈窕来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47067,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵宋茂叔送行五绝兼谢修叔 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"太息平原生事疏，老来亦欲事犁锄。\n傥然识得箪瓢乐，祇见何妨有不如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47068,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵宋茂叔送行五绝兼谢修叔 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"送我归舟水一篙，更携佳语赆吾曹。\n暮云真作江东去，不复沅湘诵楚骚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47069,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月一日","author":"赵蕃","text":"粤山深历备辞劳，虽有故人谁赠袍。\n归卧茅斋且休歇，竹风山雨两萧骚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47070,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月六日 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"自把残书洗睡昏，欲求甚解与谁论。\n乍然好鸟闻深樾，忽尔荒鸡听远村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47071,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月六日 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"怪底朝来暖欲昏，故应晚雨剧翻盆。\n空斋寂寞催成睡，风为捲书还闭门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47072,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月六日 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"桐花最晚开已落，春色全归草满园。\n破衲欲捐还未可，炎凉翻覆在朝昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47073,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上元口号呈莫令三首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"华灯能得几时新，明日当为刍狗陈。\n我识令君敦厚意，不能奉己厉吾民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47074,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上元口号呈莫令三首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"一盏华灯直万钱，谁知下里取薪然。\n绮纨照耀舆台体，民得褐衣犹破穿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47075,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上元口号呈莫令三首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"令君忧乐与民同，灯火随时祝岁丰。\n我亦颇怀归去乐，田蚕处处逐儿童。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47076,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上饶道中","author":"赵蕃","text":"踏土忧疑似踏船，土塍滑汰胜于舷。\n川行可怖陆行苦，谁遣为之空自怜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47077,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与庆伯广声别后有怀 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"清虚亭上晚凭栏，正我扁舟堕险艰。\n举酒纵君能酬我，未闻流水有西还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47078,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与庆伯广声别后有怀 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"万壑分争汹汹来，扁舟寸上亦难哉。\n晚晴只有山堪看，望极还忧远思哀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47079,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与成父自信同舟到饶分路而别以诗送之三首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"向来三复渭阳诗，羡汝此行亲见之。\n若问乃兄何样似，家徒四壁更书痴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47080,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]